        "raw": "The mythical Editor’s Note #45 is here\n\nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-45\n\nUpcoming schedule \n* Tuesday, May 4th: Episode #175 - Creative Process: Werewolf Stories\n* Tuesday, May 11th: Episode #176 - Writers’ Room: Hero/Villain Team-Up\n* Tuesday, May 18th: Editor’s Note #46 (TWO IN A ROW?!?!)\n* Tuesday, May 25th: Episode #177 - Creative Process: Young Legacy Foes\n\nRecording Schedule\n* Friday, April 30th: Episode #175 - Creative Process: Werewolf Stories\n* Friday, May 7th: Episode #176 - Writers’ Room: Hero/Villain Team-Up\n* Friday, May 14th: Editor’s Note #46 (TWO IN A ROW?!?!)\n* Friday, May 21st: Episode #177 - Creative Process: Young Legacy Foes\n* Friday May 28th: Episode #178: TBD",
