        "id": 236989,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-20T18:06:18.697Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m so glad this new forum lets me type notes on my laptop and not have to transfer them to my desktop to post.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>Next month is the month of May, which — as everyone knows — is Adam’s birth month! Celebrations will be occurring everywhere, and both participation and enjoyment are mandatory!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I love this. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Christopher was thinking of Pattery Barn, the barn that teaches you better techniques for doing street magic.</p>\n<p>I’m surprised there could be any books they can’t say the names of in the Multiverse timeline still! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Whaaaat could it be?</p>\n<p>3 reactions? My money’s on Mr. Fixer.</p>\n<p>How’d everyone do on the gameshow? I assume you were all playing along. I kinda forgot to keep track of how many I got right, but I didn’t do much better than Adam. Not even all the same ones wrong!</p>\n<p>Remember, kids, Guise bits are funny because they are few and far between. A precious commodity, if you will! Still funny, though.</p>",
