        "raw": "I'm so glad this new forum lets me type notes on my laptop and not have to transfer them to my desktop to post.\n\n[quote]Next month is the month of May, which — as everyone knows — is Adam's birth month! Celebrations will be occurring everywhere, and both participation and enjoyment are mandatory![/quote]\nI love this. :D\n\nChristopher was thinking of Pattery Barn, the barn that teaches you better techniques for doing street magic.\n\nI'm surprised there could be any books they can't say the names of in the Multiverse timeline still! :O Whaaaat could it be?\n\n3 reactions? My money's on Mr. Fixer.\n\nHow'd everyone do on the gameshow? I assume you were all playing along. I kinda forgot to keep track of how many I got right, but I didn't do much better than Adam. Not even all the same ones wrong!\n\nRemember, kids, Guise bits are funny because they are few and far between. A precious commodity, if you will! Still funny, though.",
